---
Axion runs as a background daemon that listens for a wake word, transcribes the command and routes it to the right brain. Commands are mapped through an extensible registry, so new actions are a JSON entry rather than new code. A Streamlit dashboard talks to the daemon over a local socket for status and quick commands.
